"Could not stop recording: %@" = "无法停止录制:%@";
"%@ is not there. The recording did not reach the disk." = "%@ 不在那里。这次录制没有写到磁盘上。";
"%@ has no data in it. The recording stopped before anything was written." = "%@ 里面没有数据。录制在写入任何东西之前就停了。";
"%@ is there and its size could not be read. It says nothing about what was captured." = "%@ 在那里,但读不到它的大小。这不代表录到的内容有问题。";
"%@ will not open. The recording was interrupted before it could be closed." = "%@ 打不开。录制在能够正常收尾之前被中断了。";
"%@ has no picture in it. No frames reached the recorder." = "%@ 里面没有画面。没有任何帧到达录制器。";
"%@ opens but its picture cannot be read." = "%@ 打得开,但它的画面读不出来。";
"%@ is much shorter than the time you recorded for. Check it before you rely on it." = "%@ 比你实际录的时间短很多。在依赖它之前先检查一下。";
"Opened %@. Zooms will be found from what changes on screen — there is no pointer track in an imported video." = "已打开 %@。缩放会从画面上的变化推得 —— 导入的视频里没有指针轨。";
"Exporting %@" = "正在导出 %@";
"Open the caption editor" = "打开字幕编辑器";
"Captions at full width, with the waveform" = "整个窗口宽度的字幕,含波形";
"split here" = "在这里分割";
"merge with the line above" = "与上一行合并";
"between lines" = "上下行之间";
"%lld caption(s)" = "%lld 句字幕";
"Show the whole recording" = "显示整段录制";
"Make captions first — the Captions section in the inspector" = "先生成字幕 —— 在 inspector 的「字幕」区";
"The pause before capture starts. It is also what hides a camera's first second, which is a dark frame settling." = "开始捕捉前的等待。它同时也盖掉镜头的第一秒 —— 那一秒是还在稳定的暗画面。";
"Your files stay where they are — only the drawing stops. Turning this on restarts Finder, which closes any Finder windows you have open. The icons come back when the recording ends, and also if Soredemo is quit or crashes while one is running." = "你的文件留在原地,只是不再被画出来。开启这个会重新启动 Finder,已打开的 Finder 窗口会被关掉。录制结束时图标会回来;Soredemo 在录制中被结束或崩溃时也会回来。";
"Kept out of the picture, not moved. Your Dock stays where it is and still works while you record — it is simply not in the video. Nothing on your Mac is changed, so there is nothing to put back. Recordings of a single window never include the Dock anyway." = "是不入镜,不是被移走。你的 Dock 留在原处,录制时照常可用 —— 它只是不在视频里。你的 Mac 上没有任何东西被改动,所以也没有东西要还原。单一窗口的录制本来就不会拍到 Dock。";
"The clock, battery, network and every icon beside them go too. Like the Dock, nothing on your Mac changes — the menu bar is still there and still works, it just is not in the recording." = "时钟、电池、网络,以及旁边每一个图标都一起不入镜。和 Dock 一样,你的 Mac 上没有任何东西改变 —— 菜单栏还在,也还能用,只是不在录制里。";
"The weather, the calendar and the battery ring on your desktop. They can say more than they look like they do — where you are, what is in your calendar this afternoon. Like the Dock, nothing on your Mac changes and Notification Center still opens normally while you record." = "桌面上的天气、日历和电池圆环。它们说出来的事情比看起来多 —— 你在哪里、今天下午日历上有什么。和 Dock 一样,你的 Mac 上没有任何东西改变,录制时通知中心也照常打得开。";
"Dragging the playhead plays the moment under it, so a sentence can be found by ear instead of by scrubbing and watching." = "拖动播放头时会播出下面那一刻的声音,所以一句话可以用听的找到,而不必一边刮一边看。";
"Turning system audio off would leave a writer input nothing ever feeds, which costs a second and a half of every recording to recover from. It goes in when the writer can be told up front that a track will not exist." = "把系统音频关掉,会留下一个永远没有东西喂它的写入器输入,而要从那个状态恢复要花掉每次录制的一秒半。它是在能够事先告诉写入器「这条轨不会存在」的时候才加进去的。";
"Works while another application is in front, which is when a recording is stopped." = "在其他应用程序在前台时也有效,而那正是录制被停止的时候。";
"An export's shape, size and GIF settings belong to the recording being exported and are in the editor's Project tab, saved with the project." = "导出的形状、大小和 GIF 设置属于被导出的那段录制,在编辑器的「Project」标签页里,和项目一起保存。";
"This page opens on its own whenever something Soredemo needs has not been granted, or is taken away later." = "每当 Soredemo 需要的某项权限尚未被授予、或后来被收回时,这一页会自己打开。";
"Drop it anywhere in the list. macOS has no way for an app to add itself." = "放到列表里任何位置都可以。macOS 没有让应用程序自己加进去的办法。";
"A mosaic averages away what it covers; a solid fill leaves nothing at all. Neither is a blur — a blur can be undone." = "马赛克把它盖住的东西平均掉;实心填充则什么都不留下。两者都不是模糊 —— 模糊是可以还原的。";
"One language per recording. A sentence that switches part-way is recognised as the chosen language throughout." = "一段录制一种语言。中途换语言的句子,会被整句当成你选的那个语言来识别。";
"One flat colour behind the recording. Match it to a brand, or to the slide this is going into." = "录制后面单一一块纯色。可以配合品牌色,或是它要放进去的那张幻灯片。";
"Nothing behind the card, so the recording can be dropped onto a page or over another clip. Export as HEVC with Alpha — it is the smallest of the two formats that keep transparency, and ProRes 4444 is around a hundred times larger for the same picture." = "卡片后面什么都没有,所以这段录制可以放到一页上、或叠在另一段视频上。用 HEVC with Alpha 导出 —— 在两种保留透明度的格式里它比较小,同样的画面 ProRes 4444 大约是它的一百倍。";
"An annotation is anchored to the recording, not to the frame — it moves with the picture when the camera zooms in on what it points at." = "批注锚定在录制上,不是锚定在画面上 —— 镜头推近它所指的东西时,它会跟着画面一起走。";
"Zooms are manual here — iOS does not share where you tap. A Bluetooth mouse paired to the device gives it a cursor to follow." = "这里的缩放是手动的 —— iOS 不会告诉外界你点了哪里。用蓝牙鼠标配对到那台设备,就会有一个光标可以跟。";
"Cut out on this Mac, frame by frame — around 21 ms each, so previews and exports take longer with this on." = "在这台 Mac 上一帧一帧抠出来 —— 每帧大约 21 毫秒,所以开着它预览和导出都会比较久。";
"The background is transparent, so only formats that keep an alpha channel are offered. HEVC with Alpha is around a hundred times smaller than ProRes 4444 for the same picture." = "背景是透明的,所以只提供保留 alpha 通道的格式。同样的画面,HEVC with Alpha 大约比 ProRes 4444 小一百倍。";
"The cut only — your clips and their in-points, against the original recording, with the camera on its own lane. None of the look travels: no zooms, no cursor, no background. DaVinci Resolve reads the same file." = "只有剪辑 —— 你的片段和它们的入点,对着原始录制,镜头放在自己的轨道上。外观完全不会跟过去:没有缩放、没有光标、没有背景。DaVinci Resolve 读得懂同一个文件。";
"Nothing on the microphone track reads as speech yet, so the bed stays at its own level." = "麦克风轨上目前还没有任何东西被判读为语音,所以垫底音维持在它自己的音量。";
