"%@ stops the recording from any application." = "在任何应用中按 %@ 都能停止录制。";
"%@ is taken by another app, so it will not stop a recording from outside Soredemo." = "%@ 已被其他应用占用，因此无法在 Soredemo 之外停止录制。";
"Save this recording before quitting?" = "退出前要保存这个录制吗?";
"Save this recording before opening another?" = "打开另一个录制前要保存这个吗?";
"Fade In" = "淡入";
"Fade Out" = "淡出";
"Trim Clip Start" = "修剪片段开头";
"Trim Clip End" = "修剪片段结尾";
"Controls" = "控制";
"Controls in the notch" = "在刘海中显示控制";
"Point at the notch to start a recording, and see the one that is running there. Off, or on a Mac without a notch, the controls are a bar at the bottom of the screen." = "把指针移到刘海上即可开始录制，正在进行的录制也会显示在那里。关闭时，或在没有刘海的 Mac 上，控制会是屏幕底部的一条栏。";
"Check for Updates…" = "检查更新…";
"Open the Release Page" = "打开发布页面";
"Later" = "以后";
"Soredemo %@ is the latest version" = "Soredemo %@ 已是最新版本";
"No release has been published yet" = "尚未发布任何版本";
"Could not check for updates" = "无法检查更新";
"GitHub could not be reached, or its answer could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "无法连接 GitHub,或无法读取它的回应。没有做任何更改。";
"Soredemo %@ is available" = "Soredemo %@ 已推出";
"You have %@. The release page has the download and what changed. If you installed Soredemo with Homebrew, run brew upgrade --cask soredemo instead." = "你目前是 %@。发布页面有下载和更新内容。如果你是用 Homebrew 安装的，请改为运行 brew upgrade --cask soredemo。";
"Asks GitHub for the latest release — one request, with nothing about you or your recordings in it. Off, it asks only when you choose Check for Updates from the Soredemo menu." = "向 GitHub 询问最新版本——只有一个请求，不含任何关于你或你的录制的信息。关闭时，只在你从 Soredemo 菜单选择“检查更新”时才询问。";
"Nothing is sent unless you ask" = "除非你要求，否则不发送任何东西";
"Updates" = "更新";
"Check for updates when Soredemo starts" = "启动 Soredemo 时检查更新";
"Transcription runs on device. There is no account, no upload and no telemetry. The one request Soredemo can make is asking GitHub whether there is a newer version, and only when you choose to." = "转写在设备上运行。没有账户、没有上传，也没有遥测。Soredemo 唯一可能发出的请求，是向 GitHub 询问有没有新版本，而且只在你选择时。";
"Export Frame…" = "导出画面…";
"Saved the frame to %@." = "已把画面存成 %@。";
"Could not save the frame: %@" = "无法保存画面:%@";
"Image" = "图片";
"Picture" = "图片";
"Replace Picture…" = "替换图片…";
